<title>UK: Baltic Freight Index rose four points to 1,287.</title>
<headline>Baltic Freight Index rose four points to 1,287.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Baltic Freight Index for spot dry cargo shipping rates rose to 1,287 today from 1,283 on Aug 13, with the base being Jan 4 1985 equals 1,000. The BFI is based on the following sub-indices with rates in dollars per tonne.</p>
<p> Route Index     Rate   Prev Index  Rate</p>
<p>   1    1351    12.263	  1353    12.281</p>
<p>   1a   1252  9481.000	  1257  9519.000</p>
